{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48896","headline":"和友人题僧院蔷薇花三首 三 · 崔橹","name":"和友人题僧院蔷薇花三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露香如醉态如慵，斜压危阑草色中。\n试问更谁过野寺，无憀徒自舞春风。\n兰缸尚惜连明在，锦帐先愁入夏空。\n一日几回来又去，不能容易舍深红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}